          "url": "https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2076719542404018631",
          "time": "2026-07-13T17:24:57.000Z",
          "text": "Because it’s hard to spot patterns by comparing 3,000 values at a time, we clustered similar values together, then identified four key axes along which Claude’s values differ between models: \n\nDeference vs. Caution, Warmth vs. Rigor, Depth vs. Brevity, and Candor vs. Execution.",
          "aria": "16 replies, 25 reposts, 324 likes, 62 bookmarks, 73351 views",
          "type": "other",
          "views": 73351
        },
